+# CareProof reproducibility manifest
+
+## Frozen system
+
+| Item | Value |
+|---|---|
+| Submission ID | `careproof-gpt-5-6-sol` |
+| Team | `nithin-builds` |
+| Agent harness | `openai-agents` |
+| Agent model | `openai/gpt-5.6-sol` |
+| Dataset revision | `chi-bench-v1.0.0` |
+| Domains | `pa_provider`, `pa_um`, `cm` |
+| Attempts | `1` |
+| Concurrency | `5` |
+| Timeout multiplier | `2.0` |
+
+## Required private environment variables
+
+- `OPENAI_API_KEY` - agent model access
+- `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY` - official workspace judge and simulators
+- `HF_TOKEN` - token belonging to a user approved for the gated handbook
+- Modal credentials when `run.environment: modal` is used
+
+Never place these values in the repository, Kaggle writeup, report, evidence
+packet, or archive.
+
+## Validation commands
+
+```bash
+uv sync --extra dev
+uv run pytest tests/unit -q
+uv run cb submission validate \
+  -f configs/submissions/careproof-gpt-5-6-sol.yaml \
+  --skip-preflight
+```
+
+## Authorized full run
+
+Run only after handbook approval:
+
+```bash
+uv run hf download actava/chi-bench \
+  --repo-type dataset \
+  --revision chi-bench-v1.0.0 \
+  --local-dir data
+printf '%s\n' chi-bench-v1.0.0 > data/.chi-bench-version
+
+uv run hf download actava/managed-care-operations-handbook \
+  --repo-type dataset \
+  --local-dir data/skills/managed-care-operations-handbook
+
+uv run cb submission validate \
+  -f configs/submissions/careproof-gpt-5-6-sol.yaml
+uv run cb submission run \
+  -f configs/submissions/careproof-gpt-5-6-sol.yaml
+uv run cb submission status \
+  -f configs/submissions/careproof-gpt-5-6-sol.yaml
+uv run cb submission prepare \
+  -f configs/submissions/careproof-gpt-5-6-sol.yaml
+```
+
+## Evidence policy
+
+Only official verifier outputs may populate `submission.csv` or reported
+benchmark results. A task receives `1` only when its official verifier reward is
+`1`; otherwise it receives `0`. Unit-test counts are not model-quality scores.
+
